{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01A6vXFtpLu49dD7HjTybxSc","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /data1/workspace/weihongren/kda-runs/formal-kda-20260916--sol_execbench--L2-015_audio_sinusoidal_position_embedding_with_conv_projection/candidates.jsonl has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c1ac1ce-62a7-45ff-ba86-9406f5f1f62e","uuid":"15e1b4e7-3561-44a2-8c31-9dda13529c85","timestamp":"2026-09-17T22:21:55.211Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/data1/workspace/weihongren/kda-runs/formal-kda-20260916--sol_execbench--L2-015_audio_sinusoidal_position_embedding_with_conv_projection/candidates.jsonl","oldString":"{\"candidate_id\": \"c005\", \"candidate\": \"c005\", \"parent\": \"c004\", \"source_sha256\": \"57b1f16f1e80e2bdca7d2dbb5badd647e23b5f1b699006871a09cac8a36ba08a\", \"phase\": \"feedback\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-17T21:12:24Z\", \"hypothesis\": \"The uniform RUNTIME_ERROR is a Triton compile error at the tl.dot call convention. All three dot kernels used `acc += tl.dot(a, w, out_dtype=tl.float32)`; the `out_dtype=` kwarg is version-fragile. Switch every call to the tutorial-exact 3-arg accumulate form `acc = tl.dot(a, w, acc)` (fp32 accumulator carried in positionally, no out_dtype kwarg). Semantically identical fp32 accumulation.\", \"change_from_parent\": \"All three `acc += tl.dot(a, w, out_dtype=tl.float32)` (conv2/conv3/linear) -> `acc = tl.dot(a, w, acc)`. No other changes.\", \"changes_vs_parent\": \"tl.dot call convention only (out_dtype kwarg -> 3-arg accumulate form).\", \"validation\": {\"structural_guards\": \"pass\", \"all_workloads_pass\": false, \"per_workload\": [{\"wl\": \"w1\", \"uuid\": \"9415ba43-1612-5a34-a400-0e351edb434e\", \"status\": \"RUNTIME_ERROR\", \"passed\": false, \"speedup\": null, \"latency_ms\": null, \"ref_latency_ms\": null}, {\"wl\": \"w2\", \"uuid\": \"dedae7e8-65de-5163-9c0e-4cf292a